{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40093","label":"GODDESS FALL · Part 1"},"label":"An Ominous Red Light","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":"event_goddessfall1_01_s","speakers":{"johan":"Johan","cecil":"Cecil","noah":"Noah","harran":"Harran","isabel":"Isabel","snowwhite":"Snow White","nayuta":"Nayuta","hongryeon":"Scarlet","rapunzel":"Rapunzel"},"icons":{"johan":"si_c925_00_s","cecil":"si_c929_00_s","noah":"si_c232_00_s","harran":"si_c230_00_s","isabel":"si_c231_00_s","snowwhite":"si_c220_00_s","nayuta":"si_c223_00_s","hongryeon":"si_c222_00_s","rapunzel":"si_c221_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_1","text":"Is the Queen descending?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EdenLobby","bgArt":"edenlobby","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_goddessfall_fromthesky","movie":null,"shown":["johan","cecil"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_2","text":"She was hovering in the stratosphere just a moment ago, approximately 48 kilometers above ground.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_3","text":"She was in a rapid descent, but is now stationary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_4","text":"It's been three days now, but nothing's changed. Any idea what's going on?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_5","text":"Isn't it obvious? She's afraid of us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["noah","isabel","harran"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_6","text":"I don't think so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_7","text":"Isabel. Any chance you can do some reconnaissance?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_8","text":"Not even I can reach that kind of altitude.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_9","text":"Can you at least try to get close enough to get visual confirmation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_10","text":"Not sure... but I won't know until I try...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_11","text":"When she puts it that way, it usually means she can.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_12","text":"Commander. Should I try to get as close as possible?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_13","text":"Sure. Get ready.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_14","text":"Are you sure you're not just gonna get clobbered and knocked down after getting too close?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_15","text":"Haha, if I do, then you can catch me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_16","text":"Hehe. Sure. I'll catch you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_17","text":"Then I'm counting on you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_18","text":"What about Eden's Spear...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_19","text":"We've deployed all of Eden's internal power sources as well as some underground generators nearby.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_20","text":"We'll be able to use it soon, although it will only be operating at 50% of the total output.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_21","text":"Can you raise it any further?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_22","text":"It's possible, only if we sacrifice Eden in the process.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_23","text":"That would result in an output close to 100%, but most of Eden's facilities would be destroyed.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_24","text":"Do it. Try to secure maximum output.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_25","text":"You plan on ending this once and for all, huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_26","text":"That's what I'm hoping for.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_27","text":"The Queen is stationary right now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_28","text":"This is the perfect chance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_29","text":"Got it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_30","text":"But why is the Queen just hovering there anyway?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_31","text":"I'm not sure. Maybe she lost power and is unable to descend any further. Or maybe there's some kind of malfunction.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_32","text":"I've honestly no idea of her intentions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_33","text":"Should I go and ask?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_34","text":"You're clearly having a good time if you're in the mood to crack jokes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_35","text":"Because we'll soon be taking on the Queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_36","text":"... Right. I feel the same way too, to be honest.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_37","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_38","text":"Commander, why do you look like you just swallowed some bugs?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_39","text":"I did not.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"isabel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_40","text":"Noah! Watch your language around the Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_41","text":"But that was the face he was making.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_42","text":"Although I'm curious how you even know what that expression looks like, I'm not going to ask.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_43","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_44","text":"Why isn't the Queen coming down?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_45","text":"Are you asking me? \nIt's your job to assess the situation, Johan.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_46","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_47","text":"I refuse.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"Eden","bgArt":"eden","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["snowwhite","nayuta","hongryeon","rapunzel"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_48","text":"Verily, I did expect thou wouldst answer thus.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_49","text":"I laid aside all pursuits to respond to thy summons, and yet thou dost speak of an alliance with Eden? What utterance is this?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_50","text":"As thou well knowest, the very ends we seek diverge from those of Eden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_51","text":"Our purposes are not alike.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_52","text":"... That's right. Our goals are the same.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_53","text":"But our approaches cannot be reconciled.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_54","text":"'Tis not as though Eden did offer the folk of the Ark as sacrifice.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_55","text":"If that was a viable option, they would have done it.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_56","text":"Besides, Dorothy is in Eden.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_57","text":"She could be using us for her own ends without us knowing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_58","text":"Alas, none among us possesseth the wit to discern her machinations.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_59","text":"Young Lady Dorothy is not at Eden presently.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_60","text":"I hear say she doth reside within the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_61","text":"What...?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_62","text":"What say'st thou? Why would Dorothy find herself within the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_63","text":"Wait, don't tell me...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_64","text":"Maidens. Are ye aware that a breach hath opened in the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_65","text":"What's that supposed to mean this time?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_66","text":"What?!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_67","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Loca