null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_75","text":"Maidens, are ye privy to the means of gaining entry to the Ark?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_76","text":"We don't know, but we're not planning to go inside. We just need to call Dorothy out.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_77","text":"By what means?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_78","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_78","text":"We can just ask him to do so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"nayuta","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_79","text":"If 'tis the Great Hero thou speakest of, he is soaring through the skies upon the White Giant at this hour.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_goddessfall1_prologue_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_goddessfall1_prologue_80","text":"I can't make heads or tails of what you're saying. Let's go to the Ark.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affini